<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>
    <h1>About Deadweight</h1>
    <p class="lead">Deadweight is a student-run move-out storage service built for the realities of campus life.</p>

    <p class="description">Every spring, students face the same scramble: lease ending, dorm closing, and nowhere to put a summer's worth of belongings. Hauling everything home and back again is expensive and exhausting. Deadweight exists to make that problem disappear &mdash; we pick up, store, and return your things so the only thing you carry home is a backpack.</p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Built for students</h3>
            <p>Flexible pickup and return windows that line up with the academic calendar, not a generic moving schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>Accountable by design</h3>
            <p>Each item is logged and photographed, and every status change is recorded so you always know where your things are.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
            <h3>People you can reach</h3>
            <p>Real staff handle pickups and questions. Send us a message and a person gets back to you.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary">See how it works</a>
        <a href="/requests/new" class="btn btn-primary">Request storage</a>
    </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
